The two results are not equal because exponentiation has higher
precedence that negation.  Use parentheses when you are unsure of
precedence rules.

> x <- -4
> y <- -0.5
> x^y
[1] NA
> -4^-0.5
[1] -0.5
> (-4)^(-0.5)
[1] NA

The NA is a result of asking for a fractional power of a negative number
as described in the help file.

