From: jfox at mcmaster.ca (John Fox)
Date: Wed, 09 Oct 2002 12:47:45 -0400
Subject: Re: shift and scale distribution
In-Reply-To: <OE76qSSf7roC0UpGDKN00009363@hotmail.com>
