One other caution---if you log transform your data, be careful transforming it 
back to
the original scale.  That can lead to substantial downward "transformation 
bias,"
which seems not to be sufficiently well known.  For more on that, you might see
Parkhurst, D. F. 1998. Arithmetic versus geometric means for environmental
concentration data. Environmental Science and Technology 32: 92A-98A. and 
references
therein.

